{"id":"B2-L192","title":"Participle clauses — practice and contrast","cefr":"B2","level":"B2","unit":"B2-U11","focus":"Participle clauses — introdução — prática e contraste","targets":{"grammar":"Participle clauses — introdução — prática e contraste","pron":"Flap T americano","verbs":[],"pv":[],"expr":[],"words":["trajectory calculation","orbital flight","mathematics gift","manual verification","space agency","computing pool","flight path","launch window","astronaut request","segregated office","civil rights era","medal ceremony","hidden figures","college graduate","school teaching","early talent","mission control","numerical accuracy","slide rule","chalkboard equation"],"field":"Desenvolvimento profissional","genre":"Biografia","skill":"Escuta","words_min":20},"frames":[{"tag":"Abertura","title":"Lesson 192 · Participle clauses — practice and contrast","blocks":[{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Nesta aula","body":["**Foco:** Participle clauses — introdução — prática e contraste.","**Pronúncia:** Flap T americano.","**20 palavras novas** (desenvolvimento profissional).","**Texto do dia:** biografia."]},{"type":"p","t":"**Objetivo de comunicação (B2):** eu consigo contrastar orações participiais (-ing, particípio passado, having + particípio) ao ouvir uma biografia."},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Ponte para as provas","body":["","Esta aula treina **ouvir e anotar informações (IELTS Listening, TOEFL Listening)**."]}]},{"tag":"Aquecimento","title":"Warm-up · Say the words","blocks":[{"type":"p","t":"Toque em 🔊, ouça e repita cada palavra. Depois tente adivinhar o sentido."},{"type":"words","items":[["trajectory calculation","cálculo de trajetória"],["orbital flight","voo orbital"],["mathematics gift","talento para matemática"],["manual verification","verificação manual"],["space agency","agência espacial"],["computing pool","equipe de cálculo"],["flight path","trajetória de voo"],["launch window","janela de lançamento"],["astronaut request","pedido de astronauta"],["segregated office","escritório segregado"],["civil rights era","era dos direitos civis"],["medal ceremony","cerimônia de medalha"],["hidden figures","figuras ocultas"],["college graduate","graduado universitário"],["school teaching","ensino escolar"],["early talent","talento precoce"],["mission control","controle da missão"],["numerical accuracy","precisão numérica"],["slide rule","régua de cálculo"],["chalkboard equation","equação na lousa"]]}]},{"tag":"Leitura","title":"Reading · A biography","blocks":[{"type":"bio","name":"Katherine Johnson","paras":["**Born** in West Virginia in 1918, Katherine Johnson showed a gift for numbers early. **Having graduated** from college at eighteen, she taught school. **Hired** by NASA’s predecessor in 1953, she **worked** on flight calculations. **Asked** to check a computer’s figures before a 1962 orbital flight, she confirmed them by hand.","**Receiving** the Presidential Medal of Freedom in 2015, she **said** she had simply loved her work. She died in 2020."],"years":"1918–2020","facts":[["Job","matemática"],["Country","Estados Unidos"],["Famous for","cálculos de trajetória da NASA"]],"gloss":[["gift","talento"],["flight","voo"],["figure","número"],["confirm","confirmar"]]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"Johnson was born in West Virginia.","ans":"T","why":"West Virginia."},{"q":"She graduated from college at thirty.","ans":"F","why":"eighteen."},{"q":"She received the Presidential Medal of Freedom in 2015.","ans":"T","why":"2015."}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“gift” (aqui) = ?","opts":["talento","presente","gíria"],"ans":0,"why":"gift."},{"q":"“confirm” = ?","opts":["confirmar","conformar","confinar"],"ans":0,"why":"confirm."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"Participiais: -ing × particípio × having","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Tipo","Exemplo"],"rows":[["-ing (ativo, simultâneo)","**Receiving** the medal, she smiled."],["particípio passado (passivo)","**Hired** by NASA, she worked on flights."],["having + particípio (antes)","**Having graduated** at 18, she taught."],["passivo anterior","**Having been asked**, she checked the numbers."]],"cap":"Participiais: -ing × particípio × having"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Regra","body":"Escolha: **-ing** = ao mesmo tempo; **Having + part.** = antes; **particípio passado** = passivo (*Hired…* = *Because she was hired*). Atenção: o **sujeito** deve ser o mesmo da oração principal."}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"___ in West Virginia in 1918, she showed a gift. (born)","a":"Born","why":"passivo."},{"s":"___ from college at eighteen, she taught. (graduate, perfect)","a":"Having graduated","why":"antes."},{"s":"___ by NASA, she worked on flights. (hire, part.)","a":"Hired","why":"passivo."},{"s":"___ the medal, she smiled. (receive, -ing)","a":"Receiving","why":"simultâneo."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["trajectory calculation","cálculo de trajetória"],["orbital flight","voo orbital"],["mathematics gift","talento para matemática"],["manual verification","verificação manual"],["space agency","agência espacial"]]},{"type":"order","title":"Put the words in order","items":[{"words":["did","she","do","after","college","What"],"ans":"What did she do after college","pt":"O que ela fez depois da faculdade?"},{"words":["born","Where","was","Katherine","Johnson"],"ans":"Where was Katherine Johnson born","pt":"Onde Katherine Johnson nasceu?"}]}]},{"tag":"Vocabulário","title":"Words and expressions","blocks":[{"type":"vocab","items":[{"w":"trajectory calculation","pos":"word","pt":"cálculo de trajetória","ex":"Trajectory calculation.","expt":"Cálculo de trajetória."},{"w":"orbital flight","pos":"word","pt":"voo orbital","ex":"Orbital flight.","expt":"Voo orbital."},{"w":"mathematics gift","pos":"word","pt":"talent